# Generated reference specs. `scripts/convert-reference-docs.py` renders the
# authored .docx in docs/reference/ to Markdown so sessions can grep them.
# The output stays local: this repo is public, and the specs carry internal
# strategy. The .docx are already committed, but Markdown is code-searchable
# and search-engine indexable in a way binary attachments are not. Run the
# script after cloning; see docs/reference/README.md.
docs/reference/*.md
!docs/reference/README.md
